abstract: >-
  Per-compound 32-dimensional program-usage vectors and harmonized
  6,000-gene response surfaces across eight combinatorial
  library-cell-line contexts, the pinned shared program basis, an
  evaluation-grade reference model, measured mRNA profiles of 35
  control compounds across five control contexts, and imaging,
  therapeutic-hypothesis, chemistry, and same-well annexes.
